{
  "name": "dsh-plugin-office-markdown",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "description": "DeepSeek Harness（DSH）bundle 插件：在模型读取工作区里的 Office / PDF 文件之前，用 Microsoft MarkItDown 自动把它们转成 Markdown，转换结果写在源文件旁边，因此进入上下文的只是一个 .md 路径。产物完整保留、绝不裁剪，同时返回字节数、行数、token 估算与标题结构索引，并给出「先看结构、再用 grep 定位」的读取策略；支持一次调用批量转换多个文件或整个目录。内置设置页可以检查本机的 Python 环境、按需一键配置或卸载 MarkItDown，也可以直接试转一个文件确认转换链真的可用。在 DSH 里卸载本插件时，会连同它自己记录过的 Python 环境一起清理干净。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "author": "Z8906",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/Z8906/dsh-plugin-office-markdown.git"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/Z8906/dsh-plugin-office-markdown#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/Z8906/dsh-plugin-office-markdown/issues"
  },
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "dsh-bundle",
    "cordis",
    "markitdown",
    "office",
    "pdf",
    "markdown",
    "batch-conversion",
    "token-optimization"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  }
}